{"id":"00341","root":"uni00341_1","name":{"ja":"由利　翡翠","en":"Yuri Hisui"},"title":{"ja":"【ジェイドブライド】","en":"【Jade Bride】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ジェイドブライド】 由利　翡翠","en":"【Jade Bride】 Yuri Hisui"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-05-31","limited":true,"characterId":32,"profile":{"ja":"主に前線での戦闘任務にあたる対魔忍。任務以外ではボーッとしていて、訓練などでも目立つことはない。だが、いざ戦闘となると忍法の特性を生かし、驚くほど執念深い戦いを見せる。そのギャップと口下手な性格からか、親しく付き合う友人などもおらず、基本的には一人で居る事が多い。ただ、本人は決して人嫌いなわけではなく、仲間意識も強いタイプで、仲間を傷つける者には一切の容赦を見せない。普段は非常に質素な生活を送っていて趣味もこれといってないが、餌付けした野鳥と戯れるのを日課としている。ある時、闇の町で人身売買組織が人間の女を洗脳調教し、『花嫁』として売りさばいているという情報があり、翡翠とふうまは潜入調査をする事になったのだが、それにあたり翡翠は自身が『花嫁』として潜入することを提案した。ふうまは危険かもしれないと躊躇するが、翡翠は妙にテンション高くどんどん話を進めていく。","en":"Yuri Hisui serves primarily as a frontline combat Taimanin. Outside of missions she appears absent-minded and never stands out in training. Yet when battle begins she leverages her ninjutsu's traits to fight with astonishing tenacity. This stark contrast, combined with her tongue-tongue-clumsy nature, leaves her without close friends, and she usually spends time alone. She isn't antisocial, however, and feels a strong camaraderie; she shows no mercy to anyone who harms her comrades. She leads a very modest life, has no particular hobbies, but makes it a daily routine to play with the wild birds she feeds. One day she learned that a human-trafficking ring in the Dark City was brainwashing women and selling them as \"brides.\" She and Fuuma were assigned to investigate undercover, and Yuri proposed infiltrating the operation herself as a \"bride.\" Fuuma hesitated, fearing the danger, but Yuri's oddly high-spirited enthusiasm pushed the plan forward."},"illustrator":"柄あゆり","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00341_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[836,1672],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[102,204],"def":[108,216],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","620009"]},{"id":"uni00341_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabe